<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 20.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 20.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Friday, June 20:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,697.30 (1,695.00)	CHF  1,174.20 (1,174.20)</p>
<p>    DEM    981.38 (981.93)	  GBP  2,785.30 (2,777.10)</p>
<p>    ATS    139.37 (139.58)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Thursday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $17.65 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$10.26 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $27.91 million ($25.89 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
